### List Lab Orders
GET localhost:8081/api/lab-orders
Accept: application/json
Accept-Language: en
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Lab Order by ID
GET localhost:8081/api/lab-orders/2a6e00e8-0b96-4cb9-b733-fa57972e757e
Accept: application/json
Accept-Language: en
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Update Lab Order
PUT localhost:8081/api/lab-orders/2a6e00e8-0b96-4cb9-b733-fa57972e757e
Content-Type: application/json
Accept-Language: en
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

