### List Lab Orders
GET /lab-orders?page=0&size=10&patientId={UUID}&fromDate=2025-05-01T00:00:00&toDate=2025-05-26T23:59:59
Accept: application/json
Accept-Language: en
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Delete Lab Order
DELETE /lab-orders/{id}
Accept-Language: en
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
